(NEWID(), NEWID(), @kennelId, '2026-07-26T11:00:00+00:00', NULL, 1, 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0, N'Run 1090 - Steyning Whitehouse Campsite', N'This run took place during a camping weekend in the ancient community of Steyning. The whole
affair started as a conversation amongst a few of the usual suspects in the spring. Cock Burns
started to put a plan together and then Bika joined in and the nucleus of what was supposed to
be a small group of us enjoying a camping weekend at a campsite where She Wee and Wayne
had parked their caravan for the summer. 
From the moment that Cock Burns put out the tentative plan for the camping weekend on our
WhatsApp group it snowballed. Somehow or other Hashers throughout the universe,
well at least from parts as far away as Oxford and Weymouth started to book places at the
campsite. The campsite owner had to blow the whistle and shout "no more". Bouncer from Brighton HHH
joined in. An actual meeting was held at chez Cock Burns where she and Bika hammered
out a timetable, and costing, there were spreadsheets and polls, and special Tee Shirts, and a
Hash on both Saturday and Sunday, and a fancy dress pub crawl, and a beer tent, and picnic,
and BBQ and games and, and, and. 
When the snowball stopped, a total of 56 hashers were able to get under the wire, some didn''t. 
The amount of time and effort needed to organise this weekend can''t be over stated. Cock Burns
and Bika took the lions share, others, Bouncer, Wayne, Bambi, and others less visible provided
support. And it''s not over until the WhatsApp group is silent, even now, a week later there is lost and
found going on, anyway reference to an obese female performer is no longer PC. 
Out of these there were 11 from Chichester, so in the following narrative there will be Hash names of
which you will have no prior knowledge. 
Bambi''s Slog, star date day 1, Friday. 

 Arrive at campsite - want to pitch tent in the corner but Dr Blood has already put a towel
down in that spot for Spiderman - we are turning into Germans slowly - my pitch now next to
Layby, she has already had her erection. I start to achieve my own erection and manage quite
well despite Dr Blood interrupting me a million times to ask if I need a hand. My own hand is
good enough I tell him. 
 Docleaf arrives to my other side, thank god, because Dr Blood now gives her the "do you
need a hand?" treatment, she does not she tells him, she has a large Skoda Superb and a
tall tent which she gets up in no time. 
 Dr Pussy and Camping Gaz arrive to complete our end of the field. As soon as they have
got theirs’ up they disappear inside and are not seen for quite a while. 
 The Spiders arrive to remove their towel, I go over to watch them getting it up, its worth
paying to watch. Dr Blood is now hovering around them, somehow Spiderman is stuck inside,
feet dangling out, shouting "leave me alone", "don''t touch anything", "I can do this!". Spiderwoman
tells me that they foolishly "loaned" their old and trusted tent to their son to take to a festival,
predictably it never returned. Old dog and new tricks is echoing around Bambi''s brain cell. 
 A short stroll reveals the "All you can drink" gazeeeeebo, name a beverage, yes, it''s there. 
 A bit further reveals the sanitation centre, sexually segregated, one shower and two Khazies
per sexual preference. Will this suffice ? 
 Time goes by. 
 Now it''s early evening, Bambi''s Templar Knight costume has been donned, it''s a bit hot under
the long tunic, cape, chain mail cloth head dress and helmet, we sally forth to join the swelling
crowd of medieval characters that are assembling. 
 Cock Burns is like Nell Gwyn, red red smoochy lips and are those oranges under her boddace? 
 The Ref is wearing a long tee shirt with medieval print on and archers leather arm guards. 
 Slightly is a pirate, Jack Sparrow I think, he has black around his eyes, like cried out mascara 
 Wayne is a knight, as he says "Once a king always a king, but once a knight is enough" 
 She Wee is a serving wench, eager to please as always 
 Sausage is …

